<!doctype html><html lang="sk"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>WDFOX Control Center</title><style>:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#05070a;--cyan:#35dcff;--green:#35e6a1;--text:#eef6ff;--muted:#93a2b2}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,#112532,#05070a 42%);font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--text)}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:34px 18px 70px}header{text-align:center}h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);margin:6px 0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cyan),var(--green));-webkit-background-clip:text;color:transparent}header p{color:var(--muted)}.nav{text-align:center;margin:20px}.btn,.card{border:1px solid #304150;background:#0c151d;color:#e5f3fb;text-decoration:none;border-radius:16px}.btn{display:inline-block;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:999px;margin:3px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:34px}.card{padding:20px;min-height:160px;transition:.2s}.card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 22px #35dcff22}.card.live{border-color:#577a49}.card.live:hover{border-color:#9cff72;box-shadow:0 0 24px #9cff7228}.card .icon{font-size:32px}.card h2{margin:10px 0 6px}.card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem}.tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;border:1px solid #394954;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 8px;color:#aebbc4;font-size:.72rem}.live .tag{color:#bfffa5;border-color:#4c6d40}@media(max-width:800px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><header><h1>WDFOX CONTROL CENTER</h1><p>Vyber oddelenie alebo systémovú vrstvu. Otvorí sa jej vlastný pracovný strom, agenti, QA, nástroje a procesy.</p></header><div class="nav"><a class="btn" href="/system-design">🌳 Celá architektúra</a><a class="btn" href="/system-design/context-engine">🧠 Context Engine</a></div><section class="grid"><a class="card live" href="/system-design/context-engine"><span class="icon">🧠</span><h2>Context Engine</h2><p>Instructions, Prompt, Examples, RAG, SQL/API, Memory a Tools/MCP → Retrieve → Filter → Compact → finálny kontext.</p><span class="tag">OTVORIŤ CONTEXT TREE →</span></a><a class="card" href="#"><span class="icon">💬</span><h2>Komunikácia</h2><p>Chat, hlas, preklad, zákaznícka komunikácia a QA.</p><span class="tag">PLÁNOVANÉ</span></a><a class="card live" href="/system-design/accounting"><span class="icon">🧾</span><h2>Účtovníctvo</h2><p>Accounting Supervisor, n8n workflow, Accounting Agent, Lexware, banka, QA a approval.</p><span class="tag">OTVORIŤ WORKSPACE →</span></a><a class="card" href="#"><span class="icon">🌐</span><h2>Web Development</h2><p>Developer Agent, Visual QA, Functional QA, preview a produkcia.</p><span class="tag">PLÁNOVANÉ</span></a><a class="card" href="#"><span class="icon">🔎</span><h2>SEO / AEO</h2><p>SEO agenti, indexácia, audit a optimalizácia odpovedí.</p><span class="tag">PLÁNOVANÉ</span></a><a class="card" href="#"><span class="icon">📧</span><h2>E-mail</h2><p>Outlook, triedenie, odpovede, workflow a kontrola.</p><span class="tag">PLÁNOVANÉ</span></a><a class="card" href="#"><span class="icon">🧑‍💼</span><h2>Management / CEO</h2><p>KPI, stav oddelení, problémy, rozhodnutia a reporty.</p><span class="tag">PLÁNOVANÉ</span></a></section></main></body></html>